  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given the solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Wg</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>100</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mL</mi></math>. The solubility in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>.</p><p>The equilibrium reaction of calcium phosphate is </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mover><mo>⇌</mo><mrow></mrow></mover></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>Ca</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>At</mi><mo> </mo><mi>equilibrium</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Ca</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>08</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p>"
